      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Mientras tanto, Sati volvió a nacer. Su nuevo nombre era Parvati: \"la hija de la montaña\".",
          "en": "Meanwhile, Sati was born again. Her new name was Parvati, \"daughter of the mountain\"."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su padre era Himavan, el rey de las montañas del Himalaya.",
          "en": "Her father was Himavan, the king of the Himalaya mountains."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un día los visitó Narada, un sabio que viaja por todos los mundos con su laúd.",
          "en": "One day, Narada came to visit. He is a wise sage who travels through all the worlds with his lute."
        },
        {
          "es": "Narada miró a la niña y dijo: \"Ella se casará con Shiva\".",
          "en": "Narada looked at the girl and said: \"She will marry Shiva.\""
        }
      ],
