      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Ya mayor, Parvati subió a la montaña a servir a Shiva. Cada día le llevaba flores y agua.",
          "en": "When she grew up, Parvati served Shiva on the mountain, bringing him flowers and water."
        },
        {
          "es": "Shiva la dejó quedarse. Pero sus ojos seguían cerrados. Ni siquiera la miraba.",
          "en": "Shiva let her stay. But his eyes stayed closed. He did not even look at her."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses estaban preocupados. Solo un hijo de Shiva podía salvarlos, y Shiva no despertaba.",
          "en": "The gods were worried. Only a son of Shiva could save them, and Shiva would not wake up."
        }
