      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Así que Indra, el rey de los dioses, llamó a Kama, el dios del amor.",
          "en": "So Indra, the king of the gods, called for Kama, the god of love."
        },
        {
          "es": "Kama lleva un arco hecho de caña de azúcar, y sus flechas son flores.",
          "en": "Kama carries a bow made of sugarcane, and his arrows are made of flowers."
        },
        {
          "es": "Quien recibe una de sus flechas se enamora.",
          "en": "Whoever is touched by one of his arrows falls in love."
        },
        {
          "es": "Indra le pidió despertar el amor en el corazón de Shiva. Kama aceptó y partió con su esposa, Rati.",
          "en": "Indra asked him to wake love in Shiva's heart. Kama went, with his wife Rati."
