      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Justo entonces, Parvati se acercó con sus flores. Kama, escondido cerca, apuntó.",
          "en": "Just then, Parvati came near with her flowers. Kama, hiding nearby, took aim."
        },
        {
          "es": "Disparó su flecha de flores. Por un momento, Shiva abrió los ojos y miró a Parvati.",
          "en": "He shot his flower arrow. For a moment, Shiva opened his eyes and looked at Parvati."
        },
        {
          "es": "Después vio a Kama con su arco. Entendió quién lo había molestado.",
          "en": "Then he saw Kama with his bow. He understood who had disturbed him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su tercer ojo, en medio de la frente, se abrió. De él salió un fuego.",
          "en": "His third eye, in the middle of his forehead, opened. Fire shot out of it."
        },
        {
          "es": "En un instante, Kama quedó convertido en cenizas.",
          "en": "In an instant, Kama was burned to ashes."
        }
      ],
