      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día llegó un joven ermitaño de pelo enredado. Le preguntó por qué sufría tanto.",
          "en": "One day, a young hermit with matted hair arrived. He asked her why she was suffering so much."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando ella dijo \"por Shiva\", él se rió: \"¿Shiva? ¡Se cubre de ceniza, lleva serpientes y monta un toro viejo!\"",
          "en": "When she said \"for Shiva\", he laughed. \"Shiva? He wears ashes and snakes, and rides an old bull!\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Parvati se enojó. \"No lo conoces\", le dijo, y le dio la espalda para irse.",
          "en": "Parvati grew angry. \"You do not know him,\" she said, and turned to leave."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces el joven cambió. Era el mismo Shiva, y sonreía.",
          "en": "Then the young man changed. It was Shiva himself, and he was smiling."
        },
        {
          "es": "Kalidasa cuenta que le dijo: \"Desde hoy soy tuyo\". Todo había sido una prueba.",
          "en": "Kalidasa tells that he said: \"From today, I am yours.\" It had all been a test."
        }
      ],
