          "en": "Shiva and Parvati made their home on Mount Kailash."
        },
        {
          "es": "Con el tiempo, su hijo Skanda, un joven dios guerrero, vencería a Taraka.",
          "en": "In time, their son Skanda, a young warrior god, would defeat Taraka."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero antes, Parvati iba a hacer un hijo con sus propias manos.",
          "en": "But first, Parvati would make a son with her own hands."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Tú habrías defendido a Shiva como Parvati, o te habrías ido?",
          "en": "Would you have defended Shiva like Parvati did, or walked away?"
        },
        {
          "es": "La próxima vez: un niño de barro cuida una puerta y no deja pasar ni a Shiva. Es El niño de barro.",
          "en": "Next time: a boy made of clay guards a door, and will not even let Shiva in. It is The Boy Made of Clay."
        }
